      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR NUM7(0000,0000)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "id": "poke_get_20_01",
      "hash": "70e77c2ff37a8258",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR NUM3(0000)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "id": "poke_get_20_02",
      "hash": "70e77f2ff37a8771",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR ITEM2(0000)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "id": "poke_get_25_01",
      "hash": "a28cf059acb43a29",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "連續捕獲　[VAR NUM3(0000)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "id": "poke_get_40_01",
      "hash": "f3d3d054a2eb0b0a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「沒想到[VAR POKNAME(0000)]竟然會\\n來到這種地方，\\r\\n真是太少見了！\\c\\n難得有這機會……\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳就練習一下\\r\\n怎麼[VAR COLOR(0006)]捕捉寶可夢[VAR COLOR(0000)]吧！\\c\\n對著寶可夢投擲[VAR COLOR(0006)]精靈球[VAR COLOR(0000)]，\\n把牠捉起來吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "id": "poke_get_40_02",
      "hash": "f3d3cf54a2eb0957",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「看來有點困難呢！\\c\\n我再給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一些精靈球，\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳再試一次看看吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "id": "poke_get_50_01",
      "hash": "67046c5e742075ed",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "請拿起Joy-Con，\\n筆直對準畫面上的精靈球。"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "id": "poke_get_50_02",
      "hash": "6704695e742070d4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "筆直對準之後，\\n按Ａ鍵選擇「準備投球」！"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "id": "poke_get_50_03",
      "hash": "67046a5e74207287",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "揮動Joy-Con投擲精靈球。"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "id": "poke_get_50_04",
      "hash": "6704675e74206d6e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "瞄準圓圈來投擲吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "id": "poke_get_50_05",
      "hash": "6704685e74206f21",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "揮動Joy-Con時，\\n請注意周圍的環境！"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "id": "poke_get_60_01",
      "hash": "d78b089360342284",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "雙手好好握住後，\\n按Ａ鍵選擇「準備投球」！"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "id": "poke_get_60_02",
      "hash": "d78b0b936034279d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "準備投球的期間，\\n可以移動主機來觀看四周。"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "id": "poke_get_60_03",
      "hash": "d78b0a93603425ea",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "按Ａ鍵朝畫面中央投擲精靈球。"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "id": "poke_get_60_04",
      "hash": "d78b059360341d6b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "瞄準圓圈來投擲吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "id": "poke_get_60_05",
      "hash": "d78b049360341bb8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "無法看清目標或移動困難時，\\n請按Ｂ鍵返回。"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "id": "poke_get_70_01",
      "hash": "1d1727bc4a7b69a7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "操作方法已變更。\\n將重新開始操作說明。"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "id": "poke_get_80_01",
      "hash": "b4ecb8880ddd1d76",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "操作模式已變更。\\n要查看操作說明嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "id": "poke_get_80_02",
      "hash": "b4ecb7880ddd1bc3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要查看投擲精靈球\\n的操作說明嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "id": "poke_get_80_03",
      "hash": "b4ecb6880ddd1a10",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "可以從「包包」裡\\n選擇樹果使用！"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "id": "poke_get_80_04",
      "hash": "b4ecbd880ddd25f5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "把球投進會動的圓圈內，\\n就有機會出現「漂亮一投」！"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "id": "poke_get_80_05",
      "hash": "b4ecbc880ddd2442",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "當圓圈變小時，\\n就是獲得更佳投擲成績的大好時機！"
    }
  ],
